---@class paypal.invoicing_v2.AmountWithBreakdown
---@field item_total? paypal.invoicing_v2.Money The subtotal for all items. Must equal the sum of (`items[].unit_amount` * `items[].quantity`) for all items.
---@field discount? paypal.invoicing_v2.AggregatedDiscount The discount can be at the item or invoice level, or both. Can be applied as a percent or amount. If you provide both amount and percent, amount takes precedent.
---@field tax_total? paypal.invoicing_v2.Money The aggregated amount of the item and shipping taxes.
---@field shipping? paypal.invoicing_v2.ShippingCost The shipping fee for all items. Includes tax on shipping.
---@field custom? paypal.invoicing_v2.CustomAmount The custom amount to apply to an invoice. If you include a label, you must include the custom amount.

