---@field id? string The ID of the invoice.
---@field parent_id? string The parent ID to an invoice that defines the group invoice to which the invoice is related.
---@field status? paypal.invoicing_v2.InvoiceStatus
---@field detail paypal.invoicing_v2.InvoiceDetail The details of the invoice. Includes the invoice number, date, payment terms, and audit metadata.
---@field invoicer? paypal.invoicing_v2.InvoicerInfo The invoicer information. Includes the business name, email, address, phone, fax, tax ID, additional notes, and logo URL.
---@field primary_recipients? paypal.invoicing_v2.RecipientInfoList
---@field additional_recipients? paypal.invoicing_v2.EmailAddressList
---@field items? paypal.invoicing_v2.ItemList
---@field configuration? paypal.invoicing_v2.Configuration The invoice configuration details. Includes partial payment, tip, and tax calculated after discount.
---@field amount? paypal.invoicing_v2.AmountSummaryDetail The invoice amount summary of item total, discount, tax total and shipping..
---@field due_amount? paypal.invoicing_v2.Money The due amount, which is the balance amount outstanding after payments.
---@field gratuity? paypal.invoicing_v2.Money The amount paid by the payer as gratuity to the invoicer.
---@field payments? paypal.invoicing_v2.Payments List of payments registered against the invoice..
---@field refunds? paypal.invoicing_v2.Refunds List of refunds against this invoice. The invoicing refund details includes refund type, date, amount, and method.
