---
---Lists invoices. To filter the invoices that appear in the response, you can specify one or more optional query parameters.
---
---`GET /v2/invoicing/invoices`
---Errors: BadRequest, Forbidden.
---@param input? paypal.invoicing_v2.ListInvoicesRequest
---@return paypal.invoicing_v2.Invoices? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:list_invoices(input) end

